  "description": "All-in-One Power: Deliver an impressive 20000mAh power reserve, providing over 4 full charges for most smartphones and at least 1.5 charges for tablets。 Intuitive Digital Display: Stay informed with the digital percentage display, offering an intuitive and precise representation of the remaining power, enhancing your charging experience. What You Get: Anker 326 Powerbank (20,000 mAh, 15W, 2-Port), welcome guide, 18-month warranty, and our friendly customer service.",
